    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d9c82eecae5d4452b544bbed944c8362",
      "statement": "The toolchain defines eight core concepts with prescribed terminology: Generator (template+inputs), Template (folder of files with placeholders), Instance (generated code on disk), Language (comparison engine by extension), Fallback (line-by-line text for unclaimed extensions), Difference (template declares, instance lacks), Error (severe difference), Conformance (0-1 score).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://CONTEXT.md#L6-L45",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3d8e037dbb6c167595d1da70774e9805834652ecb704e4b40c9b969036886ace:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_808d7152642841cdbe5c443beae3024b",
      "statement": "There are 14 templates defined in configuration/conformetry.config.ts: 5 project-level generators (jupyter-notebook-application, nestjs-command-project, nestjs-graphql-application, nestjs-service-project, tanstack-application) and 9 module/file generators (nestjs-command-module, nestjs-dataloader-module, nestjs-graphql-module, nestjs-service-file, nestjs-resolver-file, nestjs-service-module, react-component, react-hook, tanstack-route, tanstack-server-function).",
